The Bat from Hell is the "Guaranteed first sacrifice gift for Rogues"
and it is the best weapon in the game, so any rogue who finds a
co-aligned temple early (i.e. minetown) should camp at the altar until
they get it.

Slashem allows you to #twoweapon two artifacts, so you can combine the
Bat with another high-damage artifact and have a truly devastating
melee attack.

Be aware that some high-level monsters in Slashem are immune to attacks
by unenchanted weapons, so enchant them up to at least +3 as soon as
you can.

