Special shopkeeper services are very powerful in Slashem, and the
shopkeepers are very tough, so it usually pays to let them live.  The
one exception is the Black Market.
One Eye'd Sam has great armor (highly enchanted speed boots, shield of
reflection, and GDSM), and the prices are almost unbearable, so it can
be worthwhile to blast him with an assault rifle or a stack of poisoned
daggers.  Thiefbane has a decapitation attack, so do NOT engage Sam in
melee unless you #disarm him first.

Some of the shopkeeper services are REALLY powerful, like weapon shops
that offer enchanting and poisoning, armor shops that offer enchanting,
and wand, ring, and tool shops that offer charging.

